<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Filet launcher icon — foreground layer.  Candidate E4, chosen 2026-09-13.

  Two-tone open folder.  Body in the shade colour, flap in the accent.

  The gap between the two shapes is INHERENT, not masked: the body path stops at
  y=46 and the flap starts at y=53.  That is deliberate — VectorDrawable has no
  mask support, and more importantly the monochrome layer collapses both shapes to
  one colour, so a gap faked with a background-coloured shape on top would fill in
  and the mark would become a blob.  Never reintroduce one.

  Canvas 108x108, safe zone x/y 18..90.

  The paths are drawn at their natural size, which spans x 16..92 - four units
  WIDER than the safe zone - and a group scales them to fit rather than the
  coordinates being rewritten.  Two reasons for the group: the numbers stay
  readable as the shape someone drew, and the scale is one value to change if the
  mark is ever redrawn.

  This was measured, not assumed.  The comment here used to assert every edge was
  already inside the safe zone; it was not, the body reached x=16 and the flap
  x=92, and an aggressively-masking launcher clipped both.  tools/check-icon.mjs
  now flattens the paths, computes the bounds and fails if they leave the zone, so
  the claim cannot drift back into being decorative.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <!-- 0.945 about the canvas centre: 76 units of mark into a 72-unit safe zone. -->
    <group
        android:pivotX="54"
        android:pivotY="54"
        android:scaleX="0.945"
        android:scaleY="0.945">

        <!-- body + tab (shade) -->
        <path
            android:fillColor="#4E7382"
            android:pathData="M26,24h16l6,8h30a6,6 0 0 1 6,6v8H16V30a6,6 0 0 1 6,-6z" />

        <!-- front flap (accent) -->
        <path
            android:fillColor="#7FA8B8"
            android:pathData="M24,53h64a4,4 0 0 1 3.9,4.9l-5.6,24A6,6 0 0 1 80.4,86H21a4,4 0 0 1 -3.9,-4.9l5.6,-24A6,6 0 0 1 24,53z" />
    </group>

</vector>
